5:27 SMP532 regex has 2 unnamed capture groups; name them with `(?P<name>...)` so readers do not count parentheses [unsafe fix: Make the unnamed groups non-capturing]
--- fixed (1 applied, 0 remaining) ---
import re


def has_pair(text):
    return re.prefixmatch(r"(?:\w+)=(?:\w+)", text) is not None
